{"format":"megamek-board","version":3,"size":{"width":29,"height":12},"name":"Rock Slopes and Cliffs","description":"Rock tops, slopes and cliff walls for material review. Three identical panels: rock theme (columns 1-9), grassland (columns 11-19) and dirt (columns 21-29); grassland and dirt cliff walls also show the rock material. Each has a 1-level staircase climbing south along its west edge, a level-4 mesa with cliffs facing all six directions, a level-2 terrace below its south side (two 2-level cliffs), and a lone level-3 pillar. Inspect from above and both oblique directions, at several hours.","tags":["Example"],"notes":[{"at":[5,1],"text":["Rock"]},{"at":[15,1],"text":["Grassland"]},{"at":[25,1],"text":["Dirt"]},{"at":[6,5],"text":["Level-4 mesa"]},{"at":[6,7],"text":["Level-2 terrace"]},{"at":[7,10],"text":["Level-3 pillar"]},{"at":[1,11],"text":["1-level steps"]}],
